  "contentHtml": "<p>아침에 우연히 채널을 돌리다가&#160;</p><p>&#39;아무튼 출근&#39;이라는 방송을 보았습니다.</p><p>다양한 직업군의 하루 생활을 보여주고 있어서</p><p>학생들이 진로탐색하는데 도움이 되네요.&#160;</p><p>&#160;</p><p><a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=j0QHdOCCc-w\" target=\"_top\" class=\"ke-link\">https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=j0QHdOCCc-w</a>&#160;</p><div class=\"figure-video\" data-ke-type=\"video\" data-video-url=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=j0QHdOCCc-w\" data-video-host=\"youtube\" data-video-play-service=\"daum_cafe\" data-video-width=\"500\" data-video-height=\"281\" data-ke-style=\"alignLeft\" data-video-thumbnail=\"https://scrap.kakaocdn.net/dn/b8ufRE/hyJtOgdomI/dGMX27wEUhCtLtTRI9FCXk/img.jpg?width=1280&amp;height=720&amp;face=394_124_1200_378\" data-ke-mobile-mobilestyle=\"widthContent\" data-video-origin-width=\"868\" data-video-origin-height=\"488\"><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/j0QHdOCCc-w\" width=\"500\" height=\"281\" frameborder=\"0\" scrolling=\"no\" allowfullscreen=\"\"></iframe><div class=\"figcaption\"></div></div><p>진로 탐색에 도움이 되는&#160;</p><p>영상있으면 함께 공유해요~</p><p>&#160;</p>\n\t \t\t\t\t\t<!-- -->",
